codex
The local suite now completes in about two seconds: G1–G8 pass, while G9 correctly fails because no oracle attempt completed. I also found that the existing G9 transcript copies belonged to an earlier prototype, so I’m replacing those with script-owned runs against the current module—even though they will record the same quota error—so the evidence does not misstate which instance was tested.
