+        "and an exact scan is O(n + log q); at n=2400,q=1009 the reference "
+        "used 110443--110587 counted operations over eight seeds (5.790109 s "
+        "for the panel), while the compact route uses at most 198 exact "
+        "operations on the anchor triangle."
