codex
I found a substantive triage issue before shipping: the tempting affine-coloring construction has only six structure-aware candidates, so it fails the guess-resistance gate. I’m retaining the stronger native graph construction instead—a recursively composed cube two-pole family—and I’m now restoring and revalidating that module while keeping the oracle-quota failure explicit.

