codex
The official harness is reachable as a script but not as a service: all twelve bare/hinted/placebo calls returned the same 403 total-key-limit error, so there are correctly zero completed oracle attempts. I’ve marked the candidate parked—not rejected—and documented the polynomial decoder, the exact local measurements, and the archived failed prototype. I’m doing a final schema and determinism audit now.
