Implemented a self-contained Track B generator based on the paper’s native \((1^1,2^3)\)-coloring problem and Theorem 6. [Paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2602.13037)

Files:

- [gen_2602_13037.py](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2602.13037/gen_2602_13037.py)
- [selftest_report.json](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2602.13037/selftest_report.json)
